{"id":"n26229-1-9","stage":1,"title":"계산 · 计算","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26229-1-9-1","ko":"어? 계산이 틀린 것 같은데?","zh":"咦？好像算错了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계산이","meaning":"计算","explanation":"계산：计算；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"계산","audio":"/audio/563601a7b905b978111f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26229","senseId":"1","lemma":"계산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"틀린","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"틀리다：错，错误；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"틀리다","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71481","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"563601a7b905b978","term":"계산","zh":"计算","audio":"/audio/563601a7b905b978111f.mp3","entryId":"26229","definition":"数数或进行加减乘除等的运算。","pronunciation":["계ː산","게ː산"]},{"id":"5bbafb331d40a891","term":"틀리다","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3","entryId":"71481","definition":"计算或答案、事实等不正确。","pronunciation":["틀리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bdd17ccec91776bd41c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26229-1-9-2","ko":"그래? 난 원래 암산을 잘 못해서 모르겠다.","zh":"是吗？我本来就不擅长心算，所以搞不清楚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"암산을","meaning":"心算","explanation":"암산：心算；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"암산","audio":"/audio/ca6c19051ed07881bb7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:암산:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"암산","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못해서","meaning":"不会","explanation":"못하다：不会；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠다.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"ca6c19051ed07881","term":"암산","zh":"心算","audio":"/audio/ca6c19051ed07881bb7c.mp3","definition":"不用纸笔或计算器，在心里计算。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不会","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做某事做不到一定水准或没有做此事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/461d39aa4acb34a130c5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.248,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26229","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9733,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？我本来就不擅长心算，所以搞不清楚。","今天您是坐公共交通工具来公司的啊。","咦？好像算错了啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？我本来就不擅长心算，所以搞不清楚。","咦？好像算错了啊？","今天您是坐公共交通工具来公司的啊。"],"answer":0}]}
